@startuml L3_Component_Member
title NekoCafé C4 L3 - Member Service Components
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "顾客端/BFF" as Client
component "Member API Controller" as Controller
component "Identity Adapter\nOIDC/小程序登录" as Identity
component "Member Profile Service\n资料/等级/积分" as Profile
component "Preference Service\n猫咪/菜品偏好" as Preference
component "Privacy Consent Service\n授权/撤回/删除请求" as Consent
component "Coupon Wallet\n优惠券/积分账户" as Wallet
component "Policy Engine\nRBAC+ABAC" as Policy
component "Outbox Publisher\nmember-events" as Outbox
database "member_db" as DB
queue "member-events" as Events
Client --> Controller
Controller --> Identity : 登录换 token
Controller --> Profile
Controller --> Preference
Controller --> Consent
Controller --> Wallet
Profile --> Policy
Preference --> Policy
Consent --> Policy
Profile --> DB
Preference --> DB
Consent --> DB
Wallet --> DB
Consent --> Outbox : ConsentChanged
Profile --> Outbox : MemberUpdated
Outbox --> Events
note bottom of Consent
营销退订 1 分钟内生效；
删除请求 15 个工作日内闭环。
end note
@enduml
